Equiv></TextLine><TextLine id="MS_McGill_Osler391_Samarqandi_894AH_matn_line_005" custom="readingOrder {index:5;}"><Coords points="329,482 1458,482 1458,622 329,622" /><Baseline points="1458,587 893,587 329,587" /><TextEquiv><Unicode>وَلأَوْجَاعِ العَيْنِ مِنَ الرَّمَدِ وَالجَرَبِ وَالسَّبَلِ وَالحُمْرَةِ يَصْلُحُ تَقْلِيلُ الغِذَاءِ</Unicode></TextEquiv></TextLine><TextLine id="MS_McGill_Osler391_Samarqandi_894AH_matn_line_006" custom="readingOrder {index:6;}"><Coords points="452,633 1458,633 1458,688 452,688" /><Baseline points="1458,675 955,675 452,675" /><TextEquiv><Unicode>وَأَكْلُ ثَرِيدِ الخَلِّ وَالمَاءِ بِدُهْنِ اللَّوْزِ وَالسُّكَّرِ وَالسِّمْسِمِ المُقَشَّرِ [انْتَهَى]</Unicode></TextEquiv></TextLine><TextLine id="MS_McGill_Osler391_Samarqandi_894AH_matn_line_007" custom="readingOrder {index:7;}"><Coords points="584,705 1458,705 1458,768 584,768" /><Baseline points="1458,753 1021,753 584,753" /></TextLine><TextLine id="MS_McGill_Osler391_Samarqandi_894AH_matn_line_008" custom="readingOrder {index:8;}"><Coords points="391,787 1458,787 1458,848 391,848" /><Baseline points="1458,833 924,833 391,833" /></TextLine><TextLine id="MS_McGill_Osler391_Samarqandi_894AH_matn_line_009" custom="readingOrder {index:9;}"><Coords points="371,851 1458,851 1458,920 371,920" /><Baseline points="1458,903 914,903 371,903" /></TextLine><TextLine id="MS_McGill_Osler391_Samarqandi_894AH_matn_line_010" custom="readingOrder {index:10;}"><Coords points="320,924 1458,924 1458,994 320,994" /><Baseline points="1458,977 889,977 320,977" /></TextLine><TextLine id="MS_McGill_Osler391_Samarqandi_894AH_matn_line_011" custom="readingOrder {index:11;}"><Coords points="320,1006 1458,1006 1458,1162 320,1162" /><Baseline points="1458,1123 889,1123 320,1123" /></TextLine><TextLine id="MS_McGill_Osler391_Samarqandi_894AH_matn_line_012" custom="readingOrder {index:12;}"><Coords points="320,1172 1458,1172 1458,1607 320,1607" /><Baseline points="1458,1499 889,1499 320,1499" /></TextLine><TextLine id=